5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope we are all feeling well today. Let us begin by considering what we might look into first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I’m excited to help pick the best plan. I think we should check the timetable records to see how much space gets lost during construction.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I’d like to examine the staffing posts since the hiring freeze. We need to know who is left to handle the extra load.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to see the post-occupancy review ratings. We need to know which past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll review the tender records over three budget cycles. It’s time to see if our paper figures still match the market reality.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I am curious about the weather days in the site diaries. I worry about how rain and frost might delay our work.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I’d also like to check the booking data for specialist and general rooms. I want to see how heavily the finished spaces are actually used afterwards!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will also look into the bench technicians' weekly manual routines. I need to see exactly what burden they carry daily.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I will also examine the survey findings in the older blocks. I need to understand the hidden risks that delay projects before they even start.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll also check the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier. It’s a quiet trap that never makes it into the final bill.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I am quite content with my choices. I trust the rest of you will find what you need.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shizue"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shizue: I am quite content with my choices. I trust the rest of you will find what you need.""}]}"
